WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.388
The numbers tell it.

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:06.381
Simple capitalization and swap reach about ninety
percent for Llama.

00:00:06.461 --> 00:00:10.859
The compose-by-step version falls to twenty percent
or lower,

00:00:10.939 --> 00:00:12.768
with no gain from scaling.

00:00:12.848 --> 00:00:17.540
Milder separable cases climb to forty-four and
sixty-six percent.
